Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny, hello. -Hey, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 你好 -谢尔顿 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你混得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:12.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's colloquial. A conversation opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:12.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是种口语 能当作开场白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do you find the weather satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你觉得天气还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you currently sharing in the triumph of some local sports team?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你目前有没有因为 某个本地运动队伍获胜而感到开心？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: What's wrong with you? You're freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底怎么了？你吓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm striking up a casual conversation with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想跟你闲聊一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请不要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm given to understand that when you have something awkward to discuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 不过我以为如果你有件怪事想跟某人讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's more palatable to preface it with banal chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最好先从闲聊开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So this wasn't the awkward part?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以刚刚那不是奇怪的部分？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:56.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你怎样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Oh, good, I used that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 我的用法没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, you're aware that Leonard has entered into a new romantic relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 你也知道 莱纳德有了新恋情…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which includes a sexual component.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这还包含了性这个元素
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, feeling the awkward now. -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我现在开始觉得奇怪了 -等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:15.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her name is Dr. Stephanie Barnett.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:15.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫史黛芬妮巴奈特医生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she's a highly distinguished surgical resident at Fremont Memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且她是费蒙纪念医院 非常知名的外科住院医师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, Leonard told me. -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德跟我说过了 -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What he may have left out is how important this relationship is to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他可能没提到的是这段关系对我来说有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-To you? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对你来说？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:31.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, of the handful of women Leonard's been involved with...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:31.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在莱纳德交往的众多女性当中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she's the only one I have ever found tolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:34.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是唯一我觉得能接受的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The statement stands for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说得很清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:47.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, aren't you sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:47.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可真贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, should you have any interaction with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 如果你跟她有互动的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it would be most helpful that she not see you as a sexual rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果别让她觉得你是情敌的话 应该会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:57.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Yeah, I think she's pretty safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:57.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我想她会很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You say that now, but consider the following scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在是这样说没错 但之后会发生的事情可能是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're sitting in your apartment. It's late. You're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你坐在家中 夜深了 你孤单一人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your hypothalamus is swimming in a soup of estrogen and progesterone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的下丘脑充满了雌激素与黄体素…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, suddenly, even Leonard seems like a viable sexual candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后突然之间 就连莱纳德似乎都变成一个不错的性对象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:19.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or a hookup, as it's referred to by today's urban youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:19.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者是炮友 这是时下年轻人的用语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:25.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, should that happen, I would ask you to find some way to suppress your libido.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:25.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果发生了这种事 我想请你 想办法控制你的性欲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以想着你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Whatever works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 有用就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Always nice talking to you, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你聊天总是很开心 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:41.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Peace out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:41.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is very pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样让人觉得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:20.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm glad you're enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:20.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴你这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:24.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you said there would never be enough pasta for the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:24.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还说意大利面不够三个人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I stand corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我承认我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:29.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Italian housewives have a rule of thumb:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:29.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？意大利的家庭主妇 有一种拇指规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A handful of dry pasta about an inch in diameter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一把干的意大利面 直径大约2点5公分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:37.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is sufficient for each person, as it doubles in volume when cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:37.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚好够一个人吃 因为煮了之后会变成两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -She doesn't mean it. She's just being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -她不是那个意思 她只是客气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Stephanie, since Leonard seems to be dropping the conversational ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 史黛芬妮 莱纳德好像不想聊了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:50.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I guess I'll just have to pick it up. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:50.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我想得由我接手了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever witnessed a violent crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有目击过暴力犯罪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's your favorite fruit? -It, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你最爱的水果是什么？ -是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}草莓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm, technically not a fruit, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}严格来说那不是水果 但没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you do your medical internship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在哪实习的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Lawrence Memorial in Galveston, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗伦斯纪念医院 在德州的加尔维斯敦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? That's where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？我就是在那出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're kidding. SHELDON: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不会吧 -真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I spent so much of my childhood at that hospital. It--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的童年几乎都在那个医院度过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was 12, I got to ride there in a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我12岁时还搭直升机去过那边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:33.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? What happened? -Radiation burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:33.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？发生了什么事？ -辐射烫伤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little mishap while I was building my own CAT scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在做自己的电脑断层扫描机时 出了一点小差错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, you tried to build your own CAT scanner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 你自己试着做 电脑断层扫描机？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:42.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I didn't try, I succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:42.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我并不是只有试着做 我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:46.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was briefly able to see the inside of my sister's guinea pig, Snowball...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:46.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一度可以看到我姐姐的天竺鼠 雪球的体内状况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before he caught fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但后来它烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:51.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It led to an interesting expression in our house:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:51.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这让我们家出现了 一种很有趣的用语
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not a Snowball's chance in a CAT scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}雪球在电脑断层扫描机中卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:00.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:00.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:04.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I come back, just for fun, the subject will be alternative history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:04.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我回来后 我们来说些好玩的 来讲点野史吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:07.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Specifically, how would the Civil War have gone differently...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:07.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说清楚一点就是 如果林肯是未来派来的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if Lincoln had been a robot sent from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}美国内战会不会有不同的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at that, there's even pasta left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 意大利面还有剩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you understand that this was supposed to be a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知不知道这是个约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because, frankly, you've been in a foul mood since I sat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为说真的 你从我坐下开始 情绪就变得很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's my question:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我的问题是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why did you sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何要坐下？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:38.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To help. Look, if you fail at this relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:38.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是在帮你 听着 如果你这次再失败…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and history suggests you will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而根据历史显示这相当有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:46.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then we risk losing the medical officer that our landing party has always needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么我们就会失去 我们的登陆部队中一直需要的医官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What landing party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么登陆部队？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're Kirk. I'm Spock. Wolowitz is Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是柯克 我是斯波克 沃洛维茨是史考特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Koothrappali is the guy who always gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里是那个 每次都被杀死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now we've got McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们现在有麦考伊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we're all standing around looking at the post-op X-ray...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们就站在那边 一起看手术后的X光片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and there it is, clear as day, right in the guy's chest cavity:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后就清楚地看到 在那个家伙的胸腔当中…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One of my earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一只我的耳环
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:22.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:22.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 然后你怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha. What do you think I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我还能怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I discreetly slipped off the other earring...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小心地拿下另外一只耳环
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:28.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...put it in my pocket, and then got the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:29.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放到口袋里面 然后快点开溜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I have a bone to pick with you, sir. -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对你真不满
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Sheldon. -Hi, Stephanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 你好 -史黛芬妮 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I'm late, but your companion left the most indecipherable invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了 但你的伙伴 邀请我的方式很难以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么邀请？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We're going to the movies."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“我们要去看电影”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What movie? What theater? What time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么电影？哪个电影院？几点？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you were trying to make it impossible to locate you, you couldn't have done better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不想让我找到你们 你还可以做得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, clearly, I could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It took 20 minutes to go through...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我花了将近20分钟…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the browser history on your computer to see what movie times you looked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来查你电脑的浏览记录 才找到你们要看哪部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait here, I'll find us seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在这里等 我去找位置
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, no. We have seats. -Not the right seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 我们有位置了 -这个位置不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:11.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:15.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's finding the acoustic sweet spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在找音效最好的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh, does he always do this? -Sometimes he brings a toy xylophone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他总是这样吗？ -有时他会带个玩具木琴来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I am really sorry about this. -No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的很抱歉 -不…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:44.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's fine, you know. He's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 他人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON HUMS TONE]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMS TONE]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:55.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My apologies. You've been sitting in it all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:55.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是抱歉 原来你们已经坐在好位置上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, you wanna slide over one? -No. Just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 你要不要坐过去一格 -不要 你坐这里就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:05.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[THX'S "DEEP NOTE" PLAYING ON SCREEN]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard. Leonard. Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, Sheldon? What, Sheldon? What, Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛 谢尔顿…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me what you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我你看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The blunt instrument that will be the focus of my murder trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我的谋杀审判上 会被作为证物的钝器？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Stephanie's Facebook page.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是史黛芬妮的交友网站
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, where it should say "in a relationship," what does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在会写“交往中”的那个栏位 上头写了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-"Stephanie Barnett is single." -Yeah, furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-“史黛芬妮巴奈特单身” -没错 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...earlier this evening, she threw a digital sheep at some guy named Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚稍早的时候 她送了虚拟礼物给某个叫做迈克的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:51.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's Mike? Why does he get a digital sheep and not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:51.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迈克是谁？ 为何她送他礼物 没送给你？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:55.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just her Facebook page, and we've only been going out a couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:55.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是她的交友网站 而我们才交往几周而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't see it, do you? We're losing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是不懂 对吧 我们要失去她了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm gonna make this very simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我要用最简单的方式来告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:07.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are not in this relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:07.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你与我们的关系无关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才是她的男友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:13.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ergo, you have no say...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:13.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以 这与你无关…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in anything that happens between me and Stephanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论我跟史黛芬妮之间 发生了什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm afraid I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我不能允许这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pursuant to Starfleet General Order 104, Section A...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据星际舰队指导原则 第104条第1款…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you are deemed unfit, and I hereby relieve you of your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你无法胜任这个职位 我在此解除你的指挥权
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:34.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}General Order 104, Section A does not apply in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:34.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}指导原则第104条第1款 并不适用于这样的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Give me one good reason why not. -Because this is not Star Trek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请给我一个好理由 -因为我们不是在演《星际迷航》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is banana bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个香蕉面包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:55.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a door knob.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:55.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个门把
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my understanding that an unsolicited gift of food...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据我的了解 主动送别人食物…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:04.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...can be a precursor to an impromptu invitation to come in and chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:04.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对方的反应应该是 “进来聊聊天吧”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, would you like to come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你想要进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suppose I could spare a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我应该有几分钟的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were you robbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你家发生抢劫案了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么能那么确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你想干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm certain this will come as no surprise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这对你来说一定不是个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:32.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard is failing in another relationship. -He's having problems with Stephanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:32.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-但莱纳德又快要失恋了 -他跟史黛芬妮发生问题了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's sending virtual livestock to random men on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在网上 随便送其他男人虚拟礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:39.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I have any hope of keeping them together, I need data.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:39.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我想要让他们继续在一起 我需要一些数据
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Specifically, I need to know exactly what Leonard did that caused you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得详细地知道 莱纳德干了什么好事…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:45.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to pop an emotional cap in his buttocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:45.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你对他失去了欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Again, urban slang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -这也是一种俚语
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In which I believe I'm gaining remarkable fluency.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我在这方面越来越厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what is the down and the low?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以到底有哪些缺点与问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't worry, this is all entirely confidential...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 这些都会保密的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so you feel free to include any and all shortcomings in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你可以提出 床第之间的任何短处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. We never got to the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没上过床
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:14.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. All right. You know what? I'll tell you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:14.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这样吧 我就告诉你发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah. We were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们当时年纪很轻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were very much in love, but we could only communicate...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们彼此非常相爱 但我们唯一的沟通方式…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:24.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...through a time-traveling mailbox at my lake house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:24.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是通过我湖边小屋 那个能穿越时空的信箱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not enough that you made me watch that movie, but now you mock me with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你逼我看那部电影还不够 还要用它来嘲笑我？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:40.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, I have a question about dating and relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:40.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位 我有个 约会与男女关系的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told me you were gonna have the talk with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我说你要跟他谈的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been waiting for someone to have the talk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也在等某人来找我谈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:57.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More to the point, it's about finding a way to keep Leonard and Stephanie together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:57.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点就是 要想出办法 让莱纳德与史黛芬妮继续在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, I don't think you can. -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想你没办法 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:03.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at Leonard's record. Twenty-seven days with Joyce Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:03.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看莱纳德的记录 他跟乔伊丝金只交往了27天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}During which she defected to North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这期间她还逃亡去了朝鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two booty calls with Leslie Winkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与莱斯丽温克约过两次炮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:11.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For which she awarded him the nickname Speed-of-Light Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:11.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从此她给了他 光速莱纳德这个绰号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a three-hour dinner with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有跟佩妮吃了三小时的晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:19.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which would've been two and a half if they ordered the soufflé when they sat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:19.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他们坐下时点了蛋奶酥 那就只会有两个半小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on the geometric progression...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以等比数列来说…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...his relationship with Stephanie should have ended after 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他与史黛芬妮的关系 应该只能维持20分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I'm aware of the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也知道公式…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Y equals 27 days over 12 to the nth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}Ｙ等于27天除以12的n次方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The issue remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但问题还是存在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do we circumvent his inevitable rejection?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要怎么防范他必然的失败？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if you want to guarantee his appeal to Stephanie...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想要确定 史黛芬妮会一直爱着他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:40.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your best bet would be to kill all the other men on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:40.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最好的方式就是 杀了地球上所有其他男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:44.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you what you shouldn't do. That body spray...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:44.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以告诉你别做什么 不要使用那种…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where the women undress when they smell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在广告上女人闻了之后 会脱衣服的香水
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:49.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:49.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那根本没用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No matter how much you put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论你喷了多少都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:13:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that's all you've got? Apocalyptic genocide and "Go easy on the cologne"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:13:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你们只有这些办法？ 大屠杀与少喷点古龙水？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
