Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Zucchini bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}西葫芦面包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:28.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-May I come in? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:28.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我可以进去吗？ -不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. Apparently, my earlier inquiry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解 所以很显然 我之前来问你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...regarding you and Leonard crossed some sort of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于你跟莱纳德的事 有点太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So have you and I returned to a social equilibrium?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们和好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-New topic. -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新主题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:46.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you in your menstrual cycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:46.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你月经还要多久才会来？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -I've been doing some research online...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我在网上做了一些研究…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, apparently, female primates-- You know, uh, apes, chimpanzees, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很显然 雌性灵长类动物… 就是猿猴、黑猩猩还有你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--they find their mate more desirable when he's courted by another female.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们在有情敌出现的时候 会觉得自己的伴侣更有魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, this effect is intensified when the rival female...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以这个效应…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is secreting the pheromones associated with ovulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在情敌产生与排卵相关的费洛蒙时 会变得更为激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which brings me back to my question. Where are you in--?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以这就引发了我要问的问题 你的月…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:16.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Clearly, I'm 14 days too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:16.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很显然 我早来了两周
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:21.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I'm saying is, if they can cure yellow fever and malaria...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:21.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想说 如果他们可以治疗黄热病与疟疾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why can't they do something about lactose intolerance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何他们无法治疗乳糖不耐症？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you're gonna have to let this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had a little cheese dip, you farted. I thought it was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你吃了一点乳酪沾酱 放了个屁 我觉得这很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hi, Stephanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史黛芬妮你好
