Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在搞什么？ -我在帮助你跟史黛芬妮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By making constipated moose sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用这种像是麋鹿便秘的叫声？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I fail to open this and you succeed, it will establish you as the alpha male.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我打不开这罐子 但你打开了 这就会让你变成头等雄性
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:25.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, when a female witnesses an exhibition of physical domination...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:25.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 如果女性看到了 这种男性体能的展现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:27.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she produces the hormone oxytocin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:27.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的体内就会产生荷尔蒙催生素
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:31.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the two of you engage in intercourse, this will create the biochemical reaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:31.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们两个开始性交 这会让大脑产生生化反应
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:35.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which laypeople naively interpret as falling in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:35.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是一般人俗称的坠入爱河
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:38.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
