Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我打你一拳也会有用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, actually, it would, but let's see how the lid goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实是有可能的 但我们先看看打开盖子有没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:50.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not strong enough, Leonard. You'll have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:50.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不够强壮 莱纳德 你得帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-God's sakes. -Go ahead, it's pre-loosened.
