Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:16.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's got it, and that's not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:16.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没问题的 这是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:21.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is something I long ago came to peace with in my role as the beta male.
