Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's hardly hacking when you use the same password for everything, Kal-El.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这才不算是入侵 因为你所有的密码都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane? Now she's gonna think I'm desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？ 现在她会觉得我很饥渴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've destroyed this relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你毁了我们的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:39.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you wanna know the worst part?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而你想知道最糟的是什么吗？ 你根本不了解自己做错了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't understand what you did wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:46.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because you can't conceive of something that you are not an expert in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:46.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你对这些事一无所知 却还自以为是专家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:49.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-In which I am not an expert. -Don't even--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:49.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不是这方面的专家… -你不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't wanna hear another word out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想再听你多说一个字
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:55.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong, Lassie? Timmy fall down the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？灵犬莱西 提米摔到井里了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She just updated her Facebook status.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她刚刚更新了她的交友状态
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Stephanie Barnett is in a relationship with Leonard Hofstadter."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“史黛芬妮巴奈特 正与莱纳德霍夫斯塔特交往中”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:14.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:14.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a girlfriend. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有女友了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:23.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I am permitted to speak again...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:23.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请允许我再发言一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:26.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Dr. Sheldon Cooper for the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:26.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿库珀博士获得胜利
